{"3809360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pirate Skulls and Sails Online", "steam_appid": 3809360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/455d0b8017ea365f75df96e325817cdd.poster.avif?t=1763303628\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/455d0b8017ea365f75df96e325817cdd.webm?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/455d0b8017ea365f75df96e325817cdd.mp4?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pirate Skulls and Sails Online</strong> invites you to a breathtaking open-world pirate adventure where every voyage, battle, and treasure hunt unfolds in real time with players across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey as a daring captain seeking fortune and fame on the seven seas. Explore lush tropical islands, trade rare goods, raid enemy fleets, and expand your reputation among ruthless pirate crews. With deep ship customization, fast-paced naval combat, and a persistent online world, your legacy will be forged by skill, strategy, and daring courage.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/5a2846a21aa25f9052569184f71b0a1e.poster.avif?t=1763303628\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/5a2846a21aa25f9052569184f71b0a1e.webm?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/5a2846a21aa25f9052569184f71b0a1e.mp4?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚓ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Online World:</strong> Sail freely across dynamic tropical islands and open seas shared by hundreds of players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Battles &amp; Boarding Fights:</strong> Command your vessel in epic sea skirmishes or board enemy ships for close combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Ships:</strong> Upgrade your sails, cannons, and crew to dominate the ocean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure &amp; Trading:</strong> Discover buried treasures, trade valuable goods, and manage your wealth like a true pirate lord.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night:</strong> Storms, sunsets, and fog bring every voyage to life with cinematic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Reputation:</strong> Earn gold, unlock ports, and rise through the ranks to become the most feared name on the seas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/cffb0c91b237c73b4903ff6e1fb6d49e.poster.avif?t=1763303628\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/cffb0c91b237c73b4903ff6e1fb6d49e.webm?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/cffb0c91b237c73b4903ff6e1fb6d49e.mp4?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the chaos, command your ship, and carve your name into legend —<br><strong>because on these waters, only the bold survive.</strong> 🦜</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/2457a6b34ddb0e573a9c3fb8ec637dde.poster.avif?t=1763303628\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/2457a6b34ddb0e573a9c3fb8ec637dde.webm?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/2457a6b34ddb0e573a9c3fb8ec637dde.mp4?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/455d0b8017ea365f75df96e325817cdd.poster.avif?t=1763303628\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/455d0b8017ea365f75df96e325817cdd.webm?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809360/extras/455d0b8017ea365f75df96e325817cdd.mp4?t=1763303628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pirate Skulls and Sails Online</strong> invites you to a breathtaking open-world pirate adventure where every voyage, battle, and treasure hunt unfolds in real time with players across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey as a daring captain seeking fortune and fame on the seven seas. Explore lush tropical islands, trade rare goods, raid enemy fleets, and expand your reputation among ruthless pirate crews. With deep ship customization, fast-paced naval combat, and a persistent online world, your legacy will be forged by skill, strategy, and daring courage.<span 